{"tag":"p","children":["Shieldbuster Torpedoes are plasma-based torpedo weapons that create bursts of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Radiation"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Radiation","referenceId":"reference:669c428e617d7f09"}," specifically designed to overwhelm ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starship Shields"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starship_Shields","referenceId":"reference:70740894b304e903"},". The T-33 used by ",{"tag":"a","children":["K-Wing Assault Starfighters"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/K-Wing_Assault_Starfighters"}," is typical of weapons of this type. Against anything but a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Shield Rating"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Shield_Rating"},", Shieldbuster Torpedoes deal half damage. If an attack from a Shieldbuster Torpedo exceeds a target's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Shield Rating"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Shield_Rating"},", the target loses 10 points from it's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Shield Rating"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Shield_Rating"}," (rather than the normal 5). Shields damaged in this way can be recharged normally.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"table","children":["\n",{"tag":"caption","children":["Shieldbuster Torpedo Ranges\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"tbody","children":[{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"th","children":["RANGE BY CHARACTER SCALE\n"],"colspan":4},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["\n"],"rowspan":3},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["\n",{"tag":"p","children":["RANGE BY STARSHIP SCALE\n"]},"\n"],"colspan":4}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"th","children":["POINT-BLANK\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["SHORT\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["MEDIUM\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["LONG\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["POINT-BLANK\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["SHORT\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["MEDIUM\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["LONG\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["0-450 Squares\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","c